## 4. Admin Needs

Grouped by function, since "Admin" in a marketplace this complex isn't one role — it's several jobs that may map to different internal teams.

**User & Verification Management**
- Review/approve/reject Provider & Venue verification submissions (trade license, ID)
- Suspend or ban accounts; view full account history across all role profiles tied to one Identity
- Manually merge or split accounts (edge case handling)

**Content & Trust**
- Moderate reviews, profile content, portfolio media, RFQ postings for policy violations
- Dispute resolution workspace (view full RFQ→proposal→booking→payment thread for a case)
- Handle chargebacks/refund requests

**Taxonomy & Catalog**
- Add/edit/retire service categories, event types, regions
- Manage featured/curated placements in the Contributor directory independent of algorithmic ranking

**Commerce Oversight**
- View all transactions, commission collected, payout status
- Manage subscription tiers and pricing
- Issue manual credits/refunds
- Oversight of sponsorship deals (flag/approve high-value sponsorship contracts if needed)

**Platform Configuration**
- Region-specific settings: currency, tax/VAT rules (UAE vs. Morocco differ), language
- Feature flags for phased rollout (MVP vs P2 features)

**Analytics & Reporting**
- GMV, active users by role, RFQ-to-booking conversion rate, churn on Contributor subscriptions
- Exportable reports for leadership/investor reporting

**Audit**
- Immutable audit log of admin actions (who approved/suspended/refunded what, and when) — important given the platform is handling payments and business verification across two regulatory jurisdictions

