## 5. Decisions Needing Sign-Off

1. Is Venue a structurally separate role/profile, or a Provider category? (Section 2)
2. Does venue booking share the RFQ negotiation loop, or does it need an instant-book calendar path too? (3.5)
3. Contributor tier — confirm it's a visibility/subscription layer on existing Provider/Venue profiles, not a distinct account type.
4. Sponsorship — confirm direction of the marketplace: do Organizers post opportunities for Sponsors to bid on, Sponsors post budgets for Organizers to pitch, or both?
